The evaluation protocol of this repository (prompts, sampling, token caps and metric) follows the
ThinkingCap Test by BottleCapAI (https://github.com/BottleCapAI/ThinkingCap-Test, Apache License 2.0).
It is re-implemented in evaluation/; this repository contains none of that project's code.

Benchmarks, their graders and all training datasets belong to their authors. They are downloaded
from the original sources and not redistributed here; see "Data and licences" in README.md.
